// Produced 2026-08-09 by a sandboxed dispatch of the `.agents/skills/loom-calendar-experience-authoring`
// Skill (see Community JSON Migration Tracker §1b/§1c for the full context and judge verdict).
//
// This is a DELIBERATE PARTIAL package — the Skill is scoped only to the Calendar tab / `event-rsvp`
// cardSurfaceFamily, so it covers ONLY the 2 of Cedar Commons HOA's 7 real workflows that fit that shape
// (`hoa-meeting`, `hoa-facility-reservation`). It does NOT cover hoa-dues-payment, hoa-member-document,
// hoa-architectural-request, hoa-committee-decision, hoa-owner-notification, or hoa-export-evidence — all
// correctly reported as out of scope by the Skill itself (see the tracker's §1c verdict for exactly why).
//
// This is NOT the canonical Cedar Commons HOA fixture (that remains
// Loom_Communities_Workflow_Engine_CedarCommonsHOA_Example.jsonc, and the pre-this-run hand-authored
// version is preserved at Loom_Communities_Workflow_Engine_CedarCommonsHOA_Example.HAND-AUTHORED-BACKUP.jsonc).
