// the tracker's §1c verdict found the Skill's `hoa-facility-reservation` avoids a real bug present in the
// hand-authored version (`locationOverlap` placed on the `reserve` transition's guard here, the real
// IMPLEMENTED placement per guards.md §9 -- vs. the hand-authored version's `creationGuard` placement,
// which guards.md §9 also recommends but which workflow-grammar.md marks PROPOSED, not yet implemented,
// meaning the hand-authored fixture's double-booking protection never actually runs).
